      line: "This should help\u2026"
    - matchingTraits: 921
      line: "About to take on cover\u2026"
    - matchingTraits: 2
      line: "Don\u2019t have to tell me twice\u2026"
    - matchingTraits: 130
      line: "Can\u2019t be worse than where I\u2019m at now\u2026"
    - matchingTraits: 514
      line: What do you take me for, a coward? Fine, whatever you say...
    - matchingTraits: 4
      line: "I love it when you leap to my defense\u2026"
    - matchingTraits: 4
      line: No shame in a bit of self-preservation now and again, right?
    - matchingTraits: 25
      line: "This terrain should provide a defensive screen\u2026"
    - matchingTraits: 80
      line: "I do prefer a more defended position\u2026"
    - matchingTraits: 32
      line: "Even the lion must defend itself against the flies\u2026"
    - matchingTraits: 32
      line: "This should lessen the sting a bit\u2026"
